---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="SDKs">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-12">
    <a href="/" class="text-xs text-slate-500 hover:text-oxblood-700">← Back to docs</a>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900">SDKs</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base text-slate-600">
      Driftstack ships first-party SDKs for TypeScript, Python, and (planned) Go. All three expose
      identical resource shapes (sessions, api-keys, profiles, webhooks, billing, auth, account)
      generated from the same Zod single source of truth in
      <span class="font-mono">@driftstack/api-types</span>.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5">
        <h2 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">TypeScript</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-900">@driftstack/sdk</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-600">npm install @driftstack/sdk</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-slate-500">
          Status: <span class="font-mono">live</span>
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5">
        <h2 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">Python</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-900">driftstack</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-600">pip install driftstack</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-slate-500">
          Status: <span class="font-mono">live</span>
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5">
        <h2 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">Go</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-900">driftstack-go</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-600">go get github.com/driftstackdev/driftstack-go</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-slate-500">
          Status: <span class="font-mono">planned</span>
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Versioning policy</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
      SDKs version independently of the HTTP API; the API contract is the source of truth. Detailed
      at
      <a
        href="https://github.com/driftstackdev/driftstack-api/blob/main/docs/architecture/sdk-versioning.md"
        class="text-oxblood-700 hover:underline"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">docs/architecture/sdk-versioning.md</a
      > (V-177). Each language SDK ships a CHANGELOG cross-referencing API-side deprecations.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
